Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within\Nyour dreams, taking aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for your heart so it would\Nseem Stand tall and read,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,go to hell and jump for\Nparadise Every time dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous We like it serious, serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,oh Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go The balls filled between us, they\Nwill show Still what we don't know Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,working hard together Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got superpowers. Got to dream.\NDespite the rivalry, Gotta see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it through We're living in you\NThere's even charm in failure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.22,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\NIn the world we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing\Nup Our thought again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.62,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're the foolish ones.\NWe love, we'll carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core Is against
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,myself forevermore Come\Non let's do it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. The balls filled between us,\Nthey will show. So what we don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what we call adventure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It through believing in you.\NThere's even charm in failure. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's yours! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, Patakori, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A splendid victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, your win was\Ninevitable from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we were concerned, you might not\Nbe able to eat today's snack in a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've been ready and waiting\Npatiently since 3 o 'clock, as always!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We are aware of your strict commitment to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,holding your merienda at\Nthe same time each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We extend our sympathies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tea, most unfortunately, has\Nbecome cold in the last 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice tea is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how considerate of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We are extremely proud of\Nthe sweets prepared today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll find the\Nselection most appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, for a\Nman as perfect as you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,each treat is made from\Nthe perfect ingredients!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We purchased the finest Carol\Ncacao we could find on the Black
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Market and combined it with milk\Nfrom cow grazed on the Sky Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,whose life was free from stress and woe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The resulting chocolate is rich and\Nideal to dollop atop this giant donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And for this one, we whipped\Nthe highest grade cream,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,which we received fresh from\Nthe great Minister Abra himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the sublime sweetness\Nof all of you and you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I expended a tremendous amount of\NHaki in the battle with Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I intend to subdue his crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,which is currently on the run,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to take in a substantial\Namount of nourishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar shall provide me with that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The feast begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I will enter the shrine. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let anyone disturb me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall leave you to your nuts of dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he's as particular as ever. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They say no one has ever caught\Nhim in the act of eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.74,0:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's ceaselessly vigilant and can't\Nlet his guard down even during a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A pity since the whole point of\Ntea time is to unwind with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a joyless act of nutritional intake
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and solemn meditation\Nbefore his next battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to be a\Nwarrior worth over a billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Backbone of the Big Mama Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat couldn't even\Nlay a finger on the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But no surprise there, he\Ncould never stack up. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like something's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stroke hat's a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamma mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The mochi, it's jiggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:06:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stroke hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get out of that mochi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate a whole bunch, that's how! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I gotta eat every time I\Nhave a fight in this dumb place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The food doesn't even taste good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you even think to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid, you took too\Nlong, so he decided to split.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He already loves the\Nmirror world, in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He has important business today, and\Ncome to think of it, so do we. So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent the voice of\Nsomeone strong over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Observation, Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's eating donuts, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Haki again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he just smells it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably celebrating thinking he won!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He will never!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially not after an\Neasy victory like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He is meditating!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Communing with the God of War spirit in\Na solemn ceremony of the utmost dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a religious experience for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can be allowed to... intrude?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,After all of that, he\Ngot scaled and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you blame him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you expect from such\Na weaker group of pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.26,0:08:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't get far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:08:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept running till I got skinny! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how the body works!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Mock Mochi Man,\NI'm back for round two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop this ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up limits and go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go near it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We failed you, General\NKatakuri! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I love to eat donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the hosetree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A snack attack. Donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lying on my back. Donuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A forbidden sweet always\Nknocks me off my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Doughnuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my secret garden,\Nfilled with doughnuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Doughnuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,More doughnuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No judgement, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Doughnuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's more than strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's undefeated, unbeatable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's never lain down and never\Nbeen knocked down either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, he's downright\Ndisrespectful to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,His bearing is always noble,\Ncool-headed and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a single flaw about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our big brother,\Nthe man you dare to face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody is allowed to\Ndisturb me while I eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight isn't over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy on me, Kanagore, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't tell a soul, even if they\Ntry to rip the words from my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say about my mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for not seeing\Nyour death through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think there was only\None level of armament, Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My strength exceeds yours in every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You are nothing but an insect to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All who see my true\Nself must pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be allowed to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What difference will one kick make?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dodging that was easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And that attack was late?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your powers are inferior to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hurt my eyes, until\NI witness your final breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgiven!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,RAINFALL EMOTION!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're strong as hell, but not invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.34,0:16:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never hit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament should always land,\Neven against Logia-types.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So when my attacks didn't hit, it\Nseemed like you were invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Like somehow you were\Nbreaking all the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get hit like anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even defending with your armament hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When I use my fourth\Ngear, I break through!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Culmarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your mochi powers\Nthat make you strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your observation, Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Crom-Crom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rhino!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Snyder!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother is more than\Njust strong, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.62,0:19:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A warrior of superhuman talent who's never
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,fallen on his back a\Nsingle day in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more astute than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've figured me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.16,0:20:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My mochi abilities allow me to\Nchange shape and dodge efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Observation Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit, I lost my cool just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what gave you the\Nopportunity to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Observation Haki requires a clear\Nhead and a calm heart to utilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has it been\Nsince I was last punched?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At first,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it hard to believe that someone\Nlike you could defeat my brother Cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I'm beginning to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the biscuit guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Unstoppable donuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Donuts aren't even mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break, cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Power monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give you another itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.98,0:22:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.39,0:22:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.68,0:22:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door and let me inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pound, but we can't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.08,0:22:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need you to step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so cruel to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pudding gave us strict orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:23:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I just want to see chiffon,\Neven if it's just for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.72,0:23:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that big guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Mama's 25th ex-husband. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it was her at first class.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.52,0:23:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't changed a bit\Nsince the day she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Still cute as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.72,0:23:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute, a second, as\Nlong as I can see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with all that racket?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.40,0:24:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sounds like some guy is yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.08,0:24:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.22,0:24:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like they'll be coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.26,0:24:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.70,0:24:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.61,0:24:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.06,0:24:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you just saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.84,0:24:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.75,0:24:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,tomorrow morning at around 1 a .m.,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.90,0:24:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's ship should be\Nshowing up at Cacao Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.10,0:24:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,assuming we don't manage to kill\Nthem before then, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.95,0:24:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,At 1 a .m.?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.28,0:24:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan was to meet up with the Sunny\Nat sea and hand over the wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.44,0:24:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.60,0:24:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would the Straw Hats\Nwant to come to Kaku Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.92,0:24:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where they were planning\Nto meet up with their captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.52,0:24:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,who split up on the rest of the group,\Nthinking that he could help them escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.44,0:24:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.48,0:24:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the enemy knows their plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.52,0:25:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,this island's going to be\Ncrawling with their soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.14,0:25:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they do make it to Kaku Island,\NStraw Hat Luffy certainly will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.66,0:25:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.54,0:25:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That he won't be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.24,0:25:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The idiot pushed his luck and challenged\NBig Brother Katakuri to a one-on-one duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.80,0:25:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can imagine how\Nwell that's working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.92,0:25:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It serves him right, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.20,0:25:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, heave home!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.24,0:25:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's four o'clock now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That means in about nine hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.16,0:25:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats will arrive\Nat Kaku Island and wait
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.40,0:25:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,for their precious captain\Nwho will never appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.70,0:26:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama still suffering from hunger pangs and\NPress will show up around the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.08,0:26:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be gathered\Nto see the big show.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.22,0:26:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, we can't\Nafford for anything to go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.12,0:26:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you to\Ntake care of Mama Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.02,0:26:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, sis. I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.26,0:26:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mama wants the greatest wedding\Ncake ever, then that's what she'll get.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.96,0:26:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look forward to it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.96,0:26:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, if the Straw Hats happen\Nto arrive ahead of time, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.10,0:26:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oven just showed up with his troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.52,0:26:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll take care of things for you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.38,0:26:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say that Oven's here already?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.58,0:26:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean I can't enter\Nthe damn factory right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.66,0:26:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's, uh, Lake Pudding's\Norder, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.44,0:26:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.02,0:26:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if she's that insistent,\Nthen I will honor the request.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.68,0:27:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the factory is supposed to\Nbe off limits, then why the crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.84,0:27:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yes, it's about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.60,0:27:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.82,0:27:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.82,0:27:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.98,0:27:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you hurting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.98,0:27:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.22,0:27:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're a damn stalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.36,0:27:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.34,0:27:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember me, Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.38,0:27:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.36,0:27:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You used to be my stepfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.62,0:27:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you haven't forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's been a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.34,0:27:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you understand my situation, then\Nmaybe you could stop punching me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.46,0:27:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that you've got this backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.24,0:27:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.76,0:28:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lot of noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.40,0:28:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.10,0:28:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He just got a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.76,0:28:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, are you listening? To your call?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.02,0:28:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your captain's in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.66,0:28:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.38,0:28:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.68,0:28:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenging Katakuri to a\Nduel is insanely reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.24,0:28:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.10,0:28:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri's bounty is over a billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.28,0:28:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,His strength's superhuman next to Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.98,0:28:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother has never lost a\Nsingle fight in his entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's a special occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.26,0:28:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to lose for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.38,0:28:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to do our part.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.54,0:28:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's making the\Ngreatest wedding cake ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.98,0:28:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your captain is as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.32,0:28:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever defeated Katakuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.48,0:28:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's not about to lose to some\Nlame-ass pirate crew like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.84,0:28:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cue that, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.16,0:28:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.26,0:28:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.86,0:28:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.34,0:29:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we get to do a project together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.04,0:29:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.66,0:29:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.78,0:29:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone baked her?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.14,0:29:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not likely!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pony!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.60,0:29:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess nobody's coming after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.18,0:29:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must be amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.20,0:29:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd surely send pursuers\Nby now if they were able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.58,0:29:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You think something happened then?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.44,0:29:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this is a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.38,0:29:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.68,0:29:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise that we won't let our\Nguard down even for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.38,0:29:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.96,0:29:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Aladdin and the\Nothers escaped here safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.30,0:29:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they were able to\Nslip away in the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.56,0:29:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.56,0:29:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Briss, I thought Mama was\Nsupposed to be chasing Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she wrecking Nuts Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.56,0:29:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mandor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:29:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.52,0:30:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, bad news, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.36,0:30:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't have enough of that, now do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.54,0:30:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We scanned all of the waters nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.84,0:30:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched for the slugs, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.28,0:30:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.22,0:30:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.13,0:30:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean that all of\Nthe territory slugs are gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.18,0:30:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.78,0:30:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't suppose they're dead, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.80,0:30:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a single one left!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.90,0:30:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's thousands of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.80,0:30:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't all disappear at\Nonce without a single trace!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.34,0:30:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone kidnapped them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.56,0:30:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How would they pull that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.40,0:30:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we can't have enemy\Nships running wild out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.24,0:30:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and fix this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.26,0:30:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I can try, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.12,0:30:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just find out why they're gone, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.96,0:30:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving! Yasuie, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.94,0:31:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea slugs. Why don't you sing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.62,0:31:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, be carefree.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.02,0:31:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.32,0:31:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've worked hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.48,0:31:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll all have fun, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.24,0:31:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Security, let it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.28,0:31:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Transmitting, now is the time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.24,0:31:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All day!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.58,0:31:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now doesn't this feel so heavenly?
